      <h2>Context & Motivation</h2>
      <p>
        Authored as an early academic milestone exploring whether theoretical spacetime manipulations can exist consistently within established physics. Rather than treating time manipulation as speculative fiction, the study evaluated relativistic frameworks, non-inertial frames of reference, and tensor geometry.
      </p>
