    <div class="section">
      <h2>Analytical Scope</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Relativistic Kinematics:</strong> Examined velocity and gravitational time dilation governed by Special and General Relativity, evaluated against real-world orbital satellite drift.</li>
        <li><strong>Spacetime Curvature & CTCs:</strong> Analyzed mathematical formulations of Closed Timelike Curves (CTCs), cosmic strings, and wormhole metrics.</li>
        <li><strong>Causality Constraints:</strong> Evaluated classical temporal paradoxes through modern physical consistency conjectures and thermodynamic arrows of time.</li>
      </ul>
